725
00:45:33,870 --> 00:45:37,990
It's suffocating. I don't feel like making videos anymore.

726
00:45:38,070 --> 00:45:40,630
It feels like I'm working in the wrong place.

727
00:45:40,710 --> 00:45:44,070
