No justice system, and there is no one to question the system.

746
00:46:34,272 --> 00:46:36,998
Unfortunately, it looks like we are living in a dead city.

747
00:46:37,078 --> 00:46:38,670
Higher crime rate, higher corruption in

748
00:46:38,750 --> 00:46:43,370
