749
00:46:43,450 --> 00:46:48,990
My question is that, have these leaders forgotten that they will never escape from the punishment one day of judgment?

750
00:46:49,070 --> 00:46:55,170
Abheye maante hi nahi in cheezon ko. Yeh koi nahi maante, jannat dozakh nahi hai inka concept. Hota to yeh aisi harkatin nahi karte.

751
00:46:55,250 --> 00:46:59,170
Do they not fear Allah about the haram money they have stolen? Yeah, right.

752
00:46:59,250 --> 00:47:05,250
People are dying just because of them. Do you think that they ever think about what's going to happen when they die?

753
00:47:06,720 --> 00:47:08,756
We the people of Karachi are hopeless.

754
00:47:08,836 --> 00:47:09,614
Every day a son,

755
00:47:09,694 --> 00:47:15,266
