758
00:47:20,738 --> 00:47:24,355
The thing this is they never kill one man when they kill a person.

759
00:47:24,435 --> 00:47:25,802
They kill an entire family.

760
00:47:25,882 --> 00:47:30,302
They kill humanity and they kill everyone who has been ever close to that person.

761
00:47:30,382 --> 00:47:34,390
May Allah save us from these corrupt leaders, politicians and criminals.

762
00:47:34,470 --> 00:47:37,390
Allah only helps those who help themselves. We are unfair to ourselves.

763
00:47:37,470 --> 00:47:40,390
Tomorrow is Sharah Faisal.

